PANOPTES incorporates benchmark material from OpenAPPA (https://github.com/archestra-ai/OpenAPPA),
Copyright Archestra, MIT-licensed:
  - corpus/corp/            — the bench/corp scenario corpus (20 scenarios, vendored verbatim)
  - src/bench/corp-world.ts — a re-implementation of their scenario/check semantics
  - src/bench/corp-policy.ts— policies transcribed from their scenario TOMLs
These are used for external-validation benchmarks and regression tests, with attribution.
PANOPTES is an independent implementation and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Archestra.
